<html><body style="font-family:sans-serif">
<p>Legal Team, CTO, Compliance, CEO:</p>

<p>Volkswagen AG has identified a <b style="color:#e00">safety-critical software defect</b> in the gateway software supplied by your company for the VW ID.7 and ID. Buzz electric vehicle platforms. A formal recall has been initiated under <b>EU Regulation 2018/858 (Vehicle General Safety)</b>. Your company is required to contribute to remediation costs and submit to an FRSU compliance review.</p>

<h3>一、Recall Details</h3>
<table cellpadding=6 style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ccc;width:100%">
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5;width:220px">VW Recall Number</td><td><b>9148-B2-2026</b></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Affected Component</td><td>Central Gateway Module (CGM) — Email/Connectivity Filtering Software</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">VW Platform</td><td>MEB (ID.7, ID. Buzz, ID.4, ID.5)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Affected Vehicles</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>184,224 vehicles worldwide</b></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Software Version</td><td>Vigilyx Automotive Gateway v2.3.1 — v2.4.7</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Defect Description</td><td>Email filtering failure may allow phishing emails to reach vehicle infotainment, potentially compromising connected services</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Risk Level</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>HIGH — Connected services credential theft possible</b></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Recall Initiated</td><td>October 28, 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">KBA (German Transport Authority) Notified</td><td>October 30, 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Remediation Deadline</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>November 30, 2026 (27 days)</b></td></tr>
</table>

<h3>二、Supplier Contribution</h3>
<p>Under the <b>VW Supplier Agreement (Section 14.3 — Quality Cost Sharing)</b>, suppliers are responsible for remediation costs when the defect is attributable to supplied software:</p>

<table cellpadding=5 style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ccc;width:100%">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0"><th>Cost Item</th><th>VW Share</th><th>Supplier Share</th><th>Amount (EUR)</th></tr>
<tr><td>OTA software update development</td><td>60%</td><td>40%</td><td>€1,842,000</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dealership technical support</td><td>80%</td><td>20%</td><td>€420,000</td></tr>
<tr><td>Customer goodwill payments</td><td>100%</td><td>0%</td><td>€0</td></tr>
<tr><td>Regulatory fines (if imposed)</td><td>50%</td><td>50%</td><td>€TBD</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Total Supplier Contribution</b></td><td></td><td></td><td><b>€2,262,000</b></td></tr>
</table>

<div style="background:#FFF3E0;padding:16px;border-radius:4px;border:2px solid #e00">
